  "goodToKnow": "Der Sprachgebrauch is how language is actually used: im allgemeinen Sprachgebrauch (in common parlance), im juristischen Sprachgebrauch (in legal terms). Debates about gendergerechter Sprachgebrauch, such as the Gendersternchen (Lehrer*innen), are heated in Germany, and some states have banned it in schools and offices. Der Gebrauch is use: die Gebrauchsanweisung (instructions for use). It has no plural."
